00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:11,120
user's request as it hopped across 50 different microservices. Right. You could actually see that

91
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:16,200
a checkout was slow specifically because the inventory service was waiting on a database lock deep

92
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:16,970
in the backend.

