00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:35,000
distributed traces showing every hop and massive data stores of high cardinality events in generation

96
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,820
three. Should we have solved the problem? I mean.

97
00:06:38,050 --> 00:06:39,660
We can literally see everything.

