00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:45,620
Why do we even need a generation four? What's fascinating here is that human attention does not scale.

99
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:50,820
That is the fundamental inescapable math problem of modern IT. Right, there are only so many hours

100
00:06:50,820 --> 00:06:51,400
in the day.

101
00:06:51,970 --> 00:06:56,630
Generation 3 gave you the haystack and an incredibly high-resolution magnifying glass,

102
00:06:56,630 --> 00:06:59,280
but it still forced the human to find the needle.

