00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:07,980
dig through the traces. But you don't have time during an outage.

105
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:12,760
Exactly. It didn't reduce the human time required during an active outage.

106
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:17,650
Giving engineers richer data actually raised the ceiling on how long an investigation could take

107
00:07:17,650 --> 00:07:20,140
because there was always one more thread to pull.

108
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:21,680
Wow.

109
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:26,350
So generation 4, AIOps, asks a new question.

